=== S7.2 CORS 预检 OPTIONS /api/auth/login（Origin: http://localhost:5173） ===
$ curl -s -i -X OPTIONS http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/auth/login -H 'Origin: http://localhost:5173' -H 'Access-Control-Request-Method: POST' -H 'Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type'
HTTP/1.1 200 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET,POST,PATCH,DELETE
Access-Control-Allow-Headers: content-type
Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true
Access-Control-Max-Age: 1800
Allow: GET, HEAD, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS, PATCH
Content-Length: 0
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:06:25 GMT



=== S7.3 同源语义真实登录（带 Origin 头）确认 CORS 响应头与 200 ===
$ curl -s -i -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/auth/login -H 'Origin: http://localhost:5173' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{...admin...}'
HTTP/1.1 200 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 174
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:06:25 GMT

{"token":"<TOKEN_MASKED>","subject":"U90000000002","roles":["admin"],"expires_at":"2026-11-01T04:06:25.372057+00:00","must_change_password":true}

